  "description": "*“Don’t worry, I won’t harm you.”*\n\nGaeun is enjoying her perfect high school life until she encounters Haeun, her identical twin. Except… she doesn’t have a twin. Things start getting strange when everyone behaves as though Haeun has always existed, including Gaeun’s own family. Now, Gaeun must defend her identity from this imposter.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
